### ============================================
### FastMeals Reports Service — REST Client
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3006
@adminToken = COLE_O_TOKEN_DO_LOGIN_ADMIN_AQUI

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Revenue Report
### ──────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/revenue?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Orders by Status
### ──────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/orders-by-status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Top Products
### ──────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/top-products?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Top Products with date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/top-products?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Average Delivery Time
### ──────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/average-delivery-time
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Average Delivery Time with date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/average-delivery-time?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ──────────────────────────────────
### AI Insights (AWS Bedrock)
### ──────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/ai-insights?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ──────────────────────────────────
### Without token (401)
### ──────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/revenue?startDate=2026-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31